  "blocks": [
    {
      "type": "paragraph",
      "text": "RECOGNISE - How it usually looks",
      "sourcePage": 43,
      "sourceIndex": 1187
    },
    {
      "type": "paragraph",
      "text": "What is the author's purpose in writing the",
      "sourcePage": 43,
      "sourceIndex": 1188
    },
    {
      "type": "paragraph",
      "text": "text?",
      "sourcePage": 43,
      "sourceIndex": 1189
    },
    {
      "type": "paragraph",
      "text": "TERM - What the term really means",
      "sourcePage": 43,
      "sourceIndex": 1190
    },
    {
      "type": "paragraph",
      "text": "常见 purpose：inform, explain, introduce,",
      "sourcePage": 43,
      "sourceIndex": 1191
    },
    {
      "type": "paragraph",
      "text": "report, persuade, recommend, entertain, raise",
      "sourcePage": 43,
      "sourceIndex": 1192
    },
    {
      "type": "paragraph",
      "text": "awareness。",
      "sourcePage": 43,
      "sourceIndex": 1193
    },
    {
      "type": "paragraph",
      "text": "THINK - First sentence in your head: “问作者想让读者得到什么：知道、理解、相信、行动，还是享",
      "sourcePage": 43,
      "sourceIndex": 1194
    },
    {
      "type": "paragraph",
      "text": "受故事？”",
      "sourcePage": 43,
      "sourceIndex": 1195
    },
    {
      "type": "paragraph",
      "text": "WHY - Why this works: 不同文体的目的可从内容组织和语言风格判断。",
      "sourcePage": 43,
      "sourceIndex": 1196
    },
    {
      "type": "paragraph",
      "text": "STEPS - Follow this route",
      "sourcePage": 43,
      "sourceIndex": 1197
    },
    {
      "type": "paragraph",
      "text": "1 看文章主要是事实说明、观点论证还是故事叙述。",
      "sourcePage": 43,
      "sourceIndex": 1198
    },
    {
      "type": "paragraph",
      "text": "2 看是否出现行动号召/推荐。",
      "sourcePage": 43,
      "sourceIndex": 1199
    },
    {
      "type": "paragraph",
      "text": "3 看结尾：总结事实、呼吁行动、还是反思经历？",
      "sourcePage": 43,
      "sourceIndex": 1200
    },
    {
      "type": "paragraph",
      "text": "4 选最贴整篇而非单段的目的。",
      "sourcePage": 43,
      "sourceIndex": 1201
    },
    {
      "type": "paragraph",
      "text": "✏ 草稿纸上具体写什么： 圈题干人物/时间/地点/段落/核心名词/NOT；定位后在段边写题号；必要时写",
      "sourcePage": 43,
      "sourceIndex": 1202
    },
    {
      "type": "paragraph",
      "text": "“证据→选项”。",
      "sourcePage": 43,
      "sourceIndex": 1203
    },
    {
      "type": "paragraph",
      "text": "IF/THEN - If... then...",
      "sourcePage": 43,
      "sourceIndex": 1204
    },
    {
      "type": "paragraph",
      "text": "· 大量客观事实 + 解释机制 → explain/inform",
      "sourcePage": 43,
      "sourceIndex": 1205
    },
    {
      "type": "paragraph",
      "text": "· 比较优缺点并建议选择 → recommend",
      "sourcePage": 43,
      "sourceIndex": 1206
    },
    {
      "type": "paragraph",
      "text": "· 强论点+理由 → persuade",
      "sourcePage": 43,
      "sourceIndex": 1207
    },
    {
      "type": "paragraph",
      "text": "· 叙事为主+人物变化 → narrate/entertain/reflect",
      "sourcePage": 43,
      "sourceIndex": 1208
    },
    {
      "type": "paragraph",
      "text": "STOP - Stop when: 目的能解释文章总体组织。",
      "sourcePage": 44,
      "sourceIndex": 1209
    },
    {
      "type": "paragraph",
      "text": "STUCK - If you are stuck: 两个目的都可能时，问“哪个是主目的，哪个只是附带效果？”",
      "sourcePage": 44,
      "sourceIndex": 1210
    },
    {
      "type": "paragraph",
      "text": "EXAMPLE - Worked example",
      "sourcePage": 44,
      "sourceIndex": 1211
    },
    {
      "type": "paragraph",
      "text": "一篇文章介绍三种减少食物浪费的方法并给执行步骤，目的更接近 advise/recommend ways，而不仅是",
      "sourcePage": 44,
      "sourceIndex": 1212
    },
    {
      "type": "paragraph",
      "text": "inform about waste。",
      "sourcePage": 44,
      "sourceIndex": 1213
    },
    {
      "type": "paragraph",
      "text": "TRAPS - Common traps",
      "sourcePage": 44,
      "sourceIndex": 1214
    },
    {
      "type": "paragraph",
      "text": "· 把“主题”当“目的”。",
      "sourcePage": 44,
      "sourceIndex": 1215
    },
    {
      "type": "paragraph",
      "text": "· 把一个段落功能当整篇目的。",
      "sourcePage": 44,
      "sourceIndex": 1216
    },
    {
      "type": "paragraph",
      "text": "CHECK - Final check",
      "sourcePage": 44,
      "sourceIndex": 1217
    },
    {
      "type": "paragraph",
      "text": "· 作者希望读者知道还是行动？",
      "sourcePage": 44,
      "sourceIndex": 1218
    },
    {
      "type": "paragraph",
      "text": "· 有无明显说服/推荐语言？",
      "sourcePage": 44,
      "sourceIndex": 1219
    },
    {
      "type": "paragraph",
      "text": "🔧 纠错动作： 做完不要只对答案，先给错误归类。错误代码： R-L 定位错｜R-P 同义替换错｜R-I 过度推",
      "sourcePage": 44,
      "sourceIndex": 1220
    },
    {
      "type": "paragraph",
      "text": "断｜R-S 范围/程度偷换｜R-N NOT/EXCEPT漏看｜R-M 主旨范围错。",
      "sourcePage": 44,
      "sourceIndex": 1221
    },
    {
      "type": "paragraph",
      "text": "同一种错误连续出现2次 → 在对应代码旁画★，下次做题先检查这一项。",
      "sourcePage": 44,
      "sourceIndex": 1222
    },
    {
      "type": "paragraph",
      "text": "MEMORY - 30-second memory: 目的题问：作者写完想让你得到什么。",
      "sourcePage": 44,
      "sourceIndex": 1223
    },
    {
      "type": "paragraph",
      "text": "可选巩固｜5题（查完SOP后再做）",
      "sourcePage": 44,
      "sourceIndex": 1225
    },
    {
      "type": "paragraph",
      "text": "1. 广告中出现Book now，主要目的可能？",
      "sourcePage": 44,
      "sourceIndex": 1226
    },
    {
      "type": "paragraph",
      "text": "2. 科普文解释机制，目的？",
      "sourcePage": 44,
      "sourceIndex": 1227
    },
    {
      "type": "paragraph",
      "text": "3. 旅游指南给景点信息，目的？",
      "sourcePage": 44,
      "sourceIndex": 1228
    },
    {
      "type": "paragraph",
      "text": "4. 作者目的能否只由主题决定？",
      "sourcePage": 44,
      "sourceIndex": 1229
    },
    {
      "type": "paragraph",
      "text": "5. purpose 与 main idea 区别？",
      "sourcePage": 44,
      "sourceIndex": 1230
    },
    {
      "type": "paragraph",
      "text": "答案速查：1. persuade/recommend readers to act/buy/book；2. explain/inform；3. inform/recommend；4.",
      "sourcePage": 44,
      "sourceIndex": 1231
    },
    {
      "type": "paragraph",
      "text": "不能，看写法和读者行动。；5. main idea=讲什么；purpose=为什么这样写。",
      "sourcePage": 44,
      "sourceIndex": 1232
    },
    {
      "type": "paragraph",
      "text": "— R13 本题型到这里。下次卡住直接 Ctrl+F 搜“R13”或题型关键词。—",
      "sourcePage": 44,
      "sourceIndex": 1233
    }
